# Per-machine path to the study-data folder: the one holding the <year> folders.
#
# Copy this file to  data_base.txt  and put your path on one line below.
# data_base.txt is gitignored, so it stays on this machine and never reaches the
# repo or the handoff bundle.
#
# The TRAFFIC_DATA_BASE environment variable wins over this file when it is set -
# that is what run_dashboard.bat and the server launcher use, so a server needs
# no data_base.txt at all.
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Quotes and %VARS% are handled.

C:\path\to\Speed and Volume Studies
